{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22443","headline":"过昭君村 · 白居易","name":"过昭君村","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵珠产无种，彩云出无根。\n亦如彼姝子，生此遐陋村。\n至丽物难掩，遽选入君门。\n独美衆所嫉，终弃出塞垣。\n唯此希代色，岂无一顾恩。\n事排势须去，不得由至尊。\n白黑既可变，丹青何足论。\n竟埋代北骨，不返巴东魂。\n惨澹晚云水，依稀旧乡园。\n妍姿化已久，但有村名存。\n村中有遗老，指点爲我言。\n不敢往者戒，恐贻来者冤。\n至今村女面，烧灼成瘢痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}